window.products.push({"id":667054,"name":"[Upgraded Larger Capacity] Rechargeable Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set - with USB Type-C Cable, LED Lights, Automatic Salt and Pepper Grinder Se","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ZgkJediL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded Larger Capacity - After collecting your valuable opinion, we have increased the capacity of spice chamber from 28 g (approx 0.98oz) to 46 g (approx 1.6 oz), up to 61%, this will be easier for you to add more salt and pepper at once. USB Rechargeable Pepper Grinder - The upgraded electric pepper grinder use a type-c cable for fast charging. Fully charged in just 1 hour. Charging for 5 minutes, this salt and pepper grinder can grind 10g of pepper, type-c USB cable is included. Stylish Modern Gift - The electric grinder is ideal for cooking or grilling and make a stylish addition to your kitchen and dining table. Exquisite packaging and modern design salt and pepper grinders make a wonderful gift for housewarming, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, Christmas, Birthday, or any other occasion. 6 Adjustable Coarseness - Easy to Use, one-button control. Just twist the knob at the top of each electric salt and pepper grinder to set your desired coarseness, The ceramic grinder is located at the top, easily control the texture of your spice grind from coarse to extra-fine 6 levels.suitable for most solid spices. Such as sea salt, black pepper, white pepper, and other spices. LED Light & Low Noise - No more cheap white light or unclear blue light, our pepper mill grinder comes with a warm LED light that is bright and gentle,the salt pepper grinder doesn't exceed 60 db when used, adding a warm and romantic atmosphere to your family or loved ones. The light will automatically turn on. Which helps to prevent the food from being over-seasoned. High Quality Material - Ceramic grinding cores grinding the spices more finely and stable. PC food-grade chamber design with no risk of glass breakages, The pepper mill grinder is made of 304 stainless steel (BPA-FREE), which is never break. Come with bottom cover to help keep your spices fresh and your kitchen tidy. 100% Satisfaction Guarantee - 90-day money back guarantee with 365-day free replacement warranty if any dissatisfaction. Customer service is online 24 hours a day and can handle anything for you. If this pepper grinder doesn't work, we recommend that you charge it for 1 hour the first time you use it. If it still doesn't work, you can replace it for free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811ZgkJediL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SELINGY","source_asin":"B09ST3LBR5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ST3LBR5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ST3LBR5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
