window.products.push({"id":667095,"name":"RUN HELIX Bathroom Rugs Sets 3 Piece, Bath Rugs for Bathroom, Bath Mats, Bathroom Sets,Extra Soft and Absorbent Shaggy Rugs, Machine Washable Bath Mat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XiVSEex0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤【PERFECT Chenille Bathroom Rugs Set】Include 1 Small Bath Rug 16\"x24\", 1 U-Shape Contoured Rug 20\"x20\", 1 Large Bath Rug 20\"x32\". Chenille material, Pamper your feet! Our bath mat features a luxurious, soft pile that soothes tired feet and keeps toes warm on the cold floor. The density and plushness of our pile will surprise you! ❤【NON-SLIP Bathroom rugs】Our chenille bathroom rugs set use anti-slip PVC backing design, friendly design for after taking shower old, child, pet. This anti-skid backing has practically slip resistance on the tile floor surface, that it won’t slip or slide to keep you more safe and cozy. The rugs are much stronger and durable for long lasting use. ❤【ULTRA Soft】Our bath mat for bathroom is made of thousands of individual microfiber shags, which are more soft and density, cozy, fuzzy, comfortable, offers exceptional softness and comfortable to your toes and protects your feet from cold bathroom floor. Each microfiber pile is about 1\" long, making your feet surrounded by thousands of individual microfiber shags. ❤【SUPERIOR Water Absorbency】The mat is consist of 3 layers, the top layer is 1\" long individual microfiber pile, which are made of thick Chenille fabric; the middle layer is sponge;the bottom is PVC mesh. With this high-quality construction, the bath rugs can help to absorb water in seconds, about 3 times water absorbency to usual type. ❤【MACHINE Washable】While most other products are not machine dryable or can only be washed a few times, our RUN HELIX Chenille Bath Rugs have been tested and can be machine washed and machine dried time and time again. Wash on cold with mild detergent. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, hang to dry or air dry flat. Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. ❤【Warm Tips】 In our luxury bath mat set there may be creases because of folding, but will be flat after using, please do not worry. Our bath rug is non-slip and can be used for any floor surface, but please wipe the floor to dry before using, if there is water or oil under the bath rug, all of the bath rugs will be slippery, so you must keep the dry floor. If you have any questions about RUN HELIX bathroom rugs sets, please contact us, and we will reply to you within 12 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XiVSEex0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUN HELIX","source_asin":"B0C695D183","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C695D183","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C695D183","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
