window.products.push({"id":667217,"name":"Air Fryer Basket Replacement, Premium Oven Basket Compatible with TOA-65AB, TOA-60 Air Fryer Toaster Oven, 304 Stainless Steel Wire Rack Baking Coolin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-R-jPioJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FOR AIR FRYER - If you can't find the right tool for your air fryer, then our air fryer basket is the right choice for you. Our air fryer baskets are compatible with TOA-65AB, and TOA-60 Air Fryer Toaster Oven to cook tastier meals with this air fryer rack set. HIGH-QUALITY STAINLESS STEE--Are you worried about food coming into contact with our baskets? Our air fryer basket are made of grade 304 stainless steel with no artificial coatings, are high temperature resistant, grill safe for use in the oven, and are non-toxic, odorless and BPA free. This high-quality stainless steel is oven safe at 500 degrees Fahrenheit, durable, won't scratch, and won't rust in the washing machine or by hand. SAFE AND PRACTICAL-- Our air fryer basket are not only designed with practicality in mind but for safety as well. The sturdy fence design structure protects your food from accidental fall due to slight tilt and avoids burns. This air fryer basket can be used in a variety of scenarios, and there is no problem in washing vegetables or grilling outdoors. It's also a favorite among traveling and outdoor grilling enthusiasts. Mesh design promotes airflow and measures 11.5\" x 10.\" x 2\" for everyday living. VERSATILE--Our air fryer basket for convection oven can be used not only for air fryer basket replacement but also for grilling or roasting ribs, meat, or fried food. It is also fine if you want to cool cakes, cookies, and bread. There are many more interesting uses waiting for you to unlock. EXCELLENT SERVICE--If you have any problems when you buy and use our air fryer basket for the oven, please contact us in time, we will reply to your questions as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-R-jPioJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yianteng","source_asin":"B0B6B4JGHH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6B4JGHH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6B4JGHH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
