window.products.push({"id":667262,"name":"MIGECON Stand Mixer Electric Kitchen Mixer Egg Stand Shampoo Frother Milk Frother Hands-free Mixer Electric Whisk Drink Mixer for Food Whipping,Whisk ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710CaQCpoNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【One-Touch Power Control】Free your hands one button controls start and pause. Splash Prevention 900ml large capacity container is included. 4 whipping sticks evenly stir. Compared to manual mixing, using electric stand mixer can save most of your time. When the host is lifted, the work will stop, which is very safe. 【Use & USB Charging】Kitchen mixer comes with a USB charging cable. It can be fully charged in about 3 hours and used15 times after being fully charged. Press the button once to work continuously for 1 minute and 30 seconds.When the host is lifted, the work will stop, which is very safe. 【Shampoo Frother】900ml large capacity container is included. Stir in a sealed state to prevent splashing of egg or cream or Shampoo. You only need to clean the container after use, not the countertop.maximum：whip up to four egg whites，250mlmilk Recommended 400ml cream.Not suitable for mixing dough.Shampoo: Helps shampoos and conditioners stick easily to the hair & skin so that you don’t waste it. 【Easy to Clean】 The host and operating container can be completely separated. The host will not be touched during the mixing process. After use, simply wash the container with water. Please note: the host cannot be cleaned, please place it in a dry place.Dishwasher cleaning is not supported. 【Styled With Versatility 】The whisker can be used to froth of milk, creamer, whole milk, & chocolate milk. Use it to froth milk for healthy shakes & smoothies, for protein powder drinks, bulletproof coffee, to mix eggs and mix egg whites and make cakes and fruit drinks and more! With the extra powerful motor, you will have the absolutely best experience.Mini Foam Maker for Coffee Latte Cappuccino Hot Chocolate. Note: Please use Whole Fat Milk for frothing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710CaQCpoNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Migecon","source_asin":"B0BDLDXN73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDLDXN73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDLDXN73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
