window.products.push({"id":667383,"name":"Hard CD Case Bright Color CD/DVD Holder for 72 Capacity CD/DVD/Blu-ray Discs Storage and Collection Great for The Car DVD Collection Sky Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819uqu6aGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you have this kind of problem?Your family has a problem. They are CONSTANTLY losing DVDs and CDs- or at least separating them from the cases. When you finally find the disc, no one has a clue where the case is. You hate putting them in single cases everywhere, as they just get strewn around. This 72 CD/DVD binder case, the perfect solution.Works very well for your ever-growing collection of DVDs and Blu-ray discs.WHAT IS THIS LIKE?1. This case is hard plastic shelled and has nice little envelopes to put DVDs in, DVD case to start your DVD collection 2. Have 4 gorgeous bright colors:sky blue,purple, pink and green.just like in the photos. 3. Inside there are black fiber pages with plastic sleeves attached to them. you have to pull out the plastic piece before inserting a CD for the first time.HOW DO THE DVD/CDs FIT?1. The sleeves are double sided.Thicker plastic that don't rip easily.2. Each sleeve holds a disc on each side for a total of 72. 3. The holes have to be punched out, but once they are, the discs slide in well. ZIPPERThe zipper on the case is to be pretty sturdy.THE BOTTOM LINEThis case is great for orphaned discs to keep them all in one place so that when the cases ever show up they can be reunited. If not, they have a place to stay.Buy what you need Exactly what you was looking for to hold you and your kids' DVD collection, just enough space for them.The opening for the CD is high up so it protects the majority of the DVD! Your kids have no problems getting them out or putting them in!This is a great semi-hard sided CD/DVD holder. If you have a DVD player in the car, so this is great for that.It’s also a kind of road trip CD/DVD storage case.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819uqu6aGtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N/H","source_asin":"B08MXRV6WN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MXRV6WN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MXRV6WN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
