window.products.push({"id":667609,"name":"TAOCOCO Reclining Loveseat with Middle Console Slipcover, 4 Piece Polyester Fabric Stretch Loveseat Reclining Sofa Covers (Black, 1 Additional Console","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oTsq1UFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【PREMIUM FABRIC】Our TAOCOCO Recliner Console Cover is crafted with a high-quality polyester blend that is soft, comfortable, and durable. The elastic characteristic of the fabric allows it to stretch easily, ensuring a comfortable fit on most loveseat recliners. It provides excellent protection and comfort for your recliner console. Please note that this product is an extra cover and does not include the sofa! 【PERFECT FIT】Here is one of the components in a suite of products. Our 2-piece recliner console cover is made to fit perfectly on most recliner console. The Additional Recliner Console Cover includes 2 separate pieces, including a console cover and an armrest cover. It is made to fit recliner sofas with a middle console that are sizes between 13 inches to 20 inches. Before you make your purchase, it's essential to follow the measurement guide to ensure you get the perfect fit for your furniture. We recommend double-checking the dimensions to avoid any sizing issues. 【EASY INSTALLATION】Our TAOCOCO Recliner Console Cover is easy to install with the included user manual. The stretch fabric will follow every corner of your recliner console with highly-fitted seam details. Simply remove the cup holders from the central console and open the armrest cover. Locate the middle consolecover and put it on. Then put on the armrest cover. Align the cover with the cup holders and ensure asnug fit Tuck any excessfabric into any gaps and securely fasten the straps. 【EASY CARE】Our Recliner Console Cover is easy to clean and maintain, making it the perfect solution for protecting your furniture from accidental spills or dirt, making it an ideal choice for homes with kids and pets. It can be hand washed or machine washed at a temperature around 30 degrees Celsius using mild laundry detergent. Please do not bleach or iron the cover. Please keep in mind that due to variations in lighting, the color of the cover may appear slightly different on different displays. To ensure the best possible match, we recommend referring to the actual color of the cover when making your purchase. 【SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】We take great pride in providing our customers with high-quality products and excellent customer service. As part of our commitment to your satisfaction, we offer a 30-day return policy for all of our products. If you have any questions or concerns regarding your purchase, our dedicated customer support team is here to assist you. Please contact us through our professional and reliable after-sales service platform on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oTsq1UFQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAOCOCO","source_asin":"B0BXD3YPCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXD3YPCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXD3YPCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
