window.products.push({"id":667632,"name":"Zak! Designs Confetti Nested Serving Bowls (Set of 3), Durable and BPA-free Melamine, Sherbet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819L4xf1XLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set of 3 nested serving bowls makes up the perfect serving bowl set in the classic confetti design. A little retro and a lot functional, this set of 3 serving bowls nest for easy compact storage and are fun, durable and full of vibrant colors. Bowls measure 11\" diameter with 4.75qt capacity, 10\" diameter with 3.4qt capacity, 8.5\" diameter with 1.75qt capacity. Easy to clean, they are dishwasher safe but do not use in the microwave. 100% BPA-free melamine that is made with 40% recycled postindustrial material which creates the look of colorful \"confetti\". Look for the complete Confetti collection. Zak; Designs offers a wide variety of dinnerware and travel ware, products at the forefront of tabletop trends for contemporary and on-the-go lifestyles. Pieces that are playful, unexpected, spirited, colorful, modern, crisp and clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819L4xf1XLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zak Designs","source_asin":"B00Z4TQS26","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667632","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Z4TQS26","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Z4TQS26","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":667633,"name":"50PCS Clothes Hanger Connector Hooks, BIGOU Heavy Duty Hanger Extender Clips, Thicken Plastic Closet Hanger Hooks for Hangers Space Saving and Clothes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lRbBcyMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👚【Notice】The round hole of the hook is 0.35 IN, which cannot be used for hangers with a neck width greater than 0.35” 👕【Save 50% Space】The space triangles for hangers is vertically connected to one hanger and the other hanger, which can save at least 3 times the space of the wardrobe, and is convenient for sorting and matching clothes. All clothes are clean and tidy without wrinkles, improving the utilization rate of the wardrobe, and no longer wasting the space used by the wardrobe. 👖【High-quality Hook】The clothes hanger is made of new environment-friendly PP material, non-toxic and odorless, with strong load-bearing capacity and good balance. The smooth edge will not scratch your clothes or skin, and can firmly support heavy clothes, weighing up to 44 pounds. If you have a small wardrobe but many clothes, they are your perfect solution. 👗【Wide Range of Applications】These hanger connecting hooks are suitable for a variety of hangers of different styles, such as stainless steel hangers, wooden hangers, plastic hangers, foam fabric hangers, ordinary velvet hangers, baby and children hangers. Please check the size of the hanger hole before purchasing, because the neck diameter of some hangers is too large to use. 👔【Store Good Helper】The hanger hook is compact, durable, and not easy to deform. It is a good closet accessory. You can hang pants, coats, shirts and skirts on the \"hanger chain\", and hang ties, belts, necklaces, bags and other small accessories at the same time, which will save you the time to choose clothes and help you use them in daily life. 👚【Good Satisfactory】The package includes 50PCS, which absolutely meets your storage requirements. Cascade hook extension clip is very helpful for restructuring narrow closets, such as dormitory closets, apartment closets, and clothing store closets. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lRbBcyMuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIGOU","source_asin":"B0B5RBRMCT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667633","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5RBRMCT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5RBRMCT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
