window.products.push({"id":667670,"name":"HOME-X Large Owl Design Ceramic Cooking Utensil Holder, Kitchen Decor for Cooking Accessories, Ceramic Utensil Holder-Multipurpose-Red-7” H x 4” D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Jp1KMsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever struggle to find the serving or cooking utensil you need? Is your drawer constantly getting jammed and cluttered because it is so packed full? If you answered yes to any of these questions, this unique utensil holder will solve your problems. Now you can have easy access to any kitchen instrument you need quickly. The owl design will look great in any room of your home, so you don’t have to restrict its use just to the kitchen. Feel free to add it to your owl collection, baby nursery, bathroom, desk, and more. Use it in your home office to hold pens, rulers, scissors, and other things you tend to use frequently. You can also use it to hold your kid's art supplies like paintbrushes and watercolors. Place it in the bathroom to hold your cosmetics. This useful storage crock makes an excellent accent piece that adds visual interest to any space and comes in a variety of striking colors that will go with any theme or style. Aside from being incredibly functional, this owl crock is very fashionable! This cute utensil holder comes in an attractive design and color. It is sure to add a pop of color to your kitchen and will go with nearly any style of decor, including farmhouse, modern, country, vintage, rustic, and more. Approximate dimensions for the exterior are 5” W x 7” H x 4” D and for the interior are 5” W x 6.5” H x 4” D so it can fit just about anything you need. It is large enough to hold a variety of household items without being too bulky or getting in the way. Get organized with this fun ceramic owl.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813Jp1KMsYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07YP8BD2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YP8BD2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YP8BD2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":667671,"name":"Frankincense Resin 1 Pound","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dhqmBr4aL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Frankincense is tapped from the very scraggly but hardy Boswellia tree by scraping the bark and allowing the exuded resins to bleed out and harden. These hardened resins are called tears. There are numerous species and varieties of frankincense trees, each producing a slightly different type of resin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dhqmBr4aL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Frankincense Resin","source_asin":"B01GUKFWPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GUKFWPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GUKFWPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
