window.products.push({"id":667682,"name":"Jayde N' Grey Talavera Hand Painted Ceramic Spoon Rest Kitchen Counter top Utensil Holder For Spoons Spanish Mexican Decorations (Small 9 x 3.5, Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nNW3KWdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jayde N' Grey Talavera pottery pieces are rare and truly one of a kind. These pieces are not mass produced in factories! Made of fine HIGH QUALITY lead free ceramic and hand painted in Mexico by skilled artisans one by one so that no two pieces are exactly alike. Due to the handmade nature, the item that you will receive may have some design or color variations compared to the image shown. 🌻 Jayde N' Grey Talavera kitchen counter spoon rest will bring a smile to your face and a dose of color to your kitchen. Made of fine HIGH QUALITY ceramic and hand painted in Mexico by skilled artisans one by one so that no two pieces are exactly alike. Our utensil holder is available in a variety of colors and sizes. Due to the handmade nature of these are produced in small batches therefore we have limited stock of each style. Our Talavera spoon rest are easy to maintain. Simply rinse off with water or use soap and water as needed. Though dishwasher safe we do recommend hand washing to keep the colors vibrant vintage floral pattern for decades to come. Our Talavera spoon rest is currently available in two sizes. The large spoon rest is perfect for large spoons and ladles while the smaller one is great for small to medium sized spoons, knives and forks as well as holding rings or jewelry while cooking.LARGE SPOON REST: 10\" long and 4.75\" across at widest point.SMALL SPOON REST: 9\" long and 3.5\" across at widest point.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nNW3KWdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jayde N' Grey","source_asin":"B086HDSTV8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HDSTV8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HDSTV8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
