window.products.push({"id":667847,"name":"GRIPTULA Multipurpose Slotted Spatula for Nonstick Cookware – Heat Resistant All-In-One Wide Egg Turner, Cooking Tongs & Pancake Flipper with Silicone","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PAF3VvWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing The Revolutionary Multipurpose Spatula Picture it now. You’re in your kitchen. Utensils misplaced everywhere. Your favorite food simmering away. In the heat of the moment, you end up using a fork as your kitchen spatula and bare hands as your cooking tongs. Sound familiar? We have an incredible way to leave all your kitchen cooking calamities in the past. With our 2 in 1 spatula tong, you can forget about all your other utensils - you won’t be needing them. You can flip your pancakes, mix your stir-fries, fold your omelets, grab hold of your sausages, and sauté your fresh vegetables. Have you had a tough time with silicone spatulas in the past? Our nylon/silicone cooking master tool - suitable for all cookware - is heat resistant and the silicone handle is contoured for extra comfort; it molds into your hand like a glove as it manipulates your food to do whatever you want. Mix, Grip & Flip Your Way to Cooking Mastery Are you ready to discover the rosetta stone of cooking utensils? After one use of our cookware friendly, silicone edge spatula, you can begin to declutter your cupboards. You will have a turner, tong, flipper, and wide spatula ready to cook all your favorite dishes. With the press of a button, you can grab a firm hold of your veggies, press again and you can go right back to flipping and mixing - a slotted turner utensil you’ll never want to put down. Easy to Clean When you’re finished, put it inside your dishwasher or wash it by hand; it will return sparkling clean every time. Let's get cooking, shall we? Press ‘Add To Cart’ now and experience a cooking revolution!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PAF3VvWwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRIPTULA","source_asin":"B08QW3QXCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QW3QXCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QW3QXCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
