window.products.push({"id":667883,"name":"Cozy Blankets - New Zealand Virgin Wool Throw Blanket, Indoor and Outdoor Blankets and Throws, Soft Blanket with Fringes and Tartan Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8153wOwYLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Luxurious, High-Quality Cozy Blankets and Throws Live naturally and comfortably with Cozy Blankets exquisite wool blankets. Made of 100% New Zealand sheep's wool, our resilient sheep's wool blankets feature all-new, natural materials crafted in our European-based factory using strict quality control measures. With classic tartan pattern and chic color combinations, these high-quality virgin wool blankets bring timeless style to your living space. Easy Comfort in Any Season A versatile choice, wool helps keep you dry and comfortable in both cold and warm weather. Wool's natural crimp creates air pockets that retain heat while repelling moisture. The result is a breathable, absorbent and insulating fabric that constantly reacts to changes in body temperature, making it ideal for seasonal use. Grab a soft blanket and curl up on the sofa with a good book, use it as an outdoor blanket at your next picnic or pack it for warmth on your yearly camping trip. 100% Natural and Renewable New Zealand Wool Blankets Sheep produce new fleece every year. Part of a natural cycle, the wool is biodegradable and recyclable, and it uses less energy than man-made fibers during manufacture. A durable choice, wool blankets are long-lasting and odor resistant, so you can use them for years to come. Non-allergenic and Asthma Safe Wool naturally absorbs and filters unwanted odors and allergens like dust and pollen; it is also a nonallergenic fiber that doesn't promote the growth of bacteria. In addition, wool is naturally flameretardant and won't burn until it reaches 700 degrees Celsius. This makes New Zealand wool comforters a safe and sensible choice for family and guests. Easy Care Our washable wool blankets feature a natural protective coating that is resistant to stains and dust. Cozy Blankets can be machine washed and tumble dried, so you can enjoy their soft and cozy comfort for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8153wOwYLmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cozy Blankets","source_asin":"B09MV1T7YX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MV1T7YX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MV1T7YX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
