window.products.push({"id":667917,"name":"VallenEnix Bamboo Steamer Basket - 10-inch, 2-Tier, Stainless Steel Adapter Ring, 4 Silicone Liners. Natural Basket Steam, Cook Asian Food, Dim Sum, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6185Uk6ddHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our high-quality 2 tier bamboo steamer is handcrafted from natural, organic bamboo. The eco-friendly and non-toxic bamboo steamer is lightweight and perfect for steaming meat and vegetables in your kitchen. In order to prevent your bamboo steamer from scorching or placing your bamboo steamer into boiling water, we have included a steamer adapter ring to be placed right underneath the bamboo steamer. The stainless steel adapter ring will fit any pots that are 7''-11'' and will send the steam directly into the bamboo steamer. The reusable silicone steamer liner is made of food-grade silicone instead of paper, which makes it very easy to clean. The small holes in the silicone steamer liner allow all of the food to be cooked equally. What is the included in the package? 2 Tier 10'' Bamboo Steamer 2 Tier 10'' Bamboo Steamer 11'' Stainless Steel Steamer Adapter Ring 11'' Stainless Steel Steamer Adapter Ring 4 Silicone Steamer Liners Custom box packaging 4 Silicone Steamer Liners Custom box packaging How to Use Your Bamboo Steamer? Step 1: Line each layer of the bamboo steamer with a silicone liner  Step 2: Place food in your bamboo steamer  Step 3: Place the bamboo steamer lid to cover the food  Step 4: Fill your pot with water  Step 5: Place the stainless steel adapter ring on top of the pot  Step 6: Place the bamboo steamer above the adapter ring  Step 7: Allow food to steam  Step 8: You are ready to serve your food!  At VallenEnix, we are set on a mission to make everyday cooking tasks more enjoyable through well-thought products. Our goal is to provide products that make positive impacts in someone’s life, allowing them to meet their daily goals and tasks. We put users at the center of our decisions and design products that address life’s needs and help you make the most of your daily activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6185Uk6ddHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VallenEnix","source_asin":"B093G2D6PT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667917","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093G2D6PT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093G2D6PT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
