window.products.push({"id":667989,"name":"CASA BOHO Decorative Pillow Cover Mid Century Modern Decor Boho Pillows Boho Throw Pillow Covers Decorative Pillows for Bed Boho Accent Pillow Midcent","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714qUz7ByjL._AC_SL1342_.jpg","description":"Style: This modern boho pillow features interesting texture and details in the wool loops, fringed designs and tassels along the sides. This pillow goes well with many different home decor styles, including bohemian, scandinavian, nordic, boho, moroccan, eclectic, mid century modern and more. Premium Quality: Our boho pillow covers are known for their supreme quality. They are well made and durable, with neatly stitched seams and thick fabric that not only looks and feels great, but will hold up to everyday wear and tear. It is finished off with a high metal YKK zipper. Details: This is a 18x18 throw pillow cover. You will not receive an insert. 90% Cotton and 10% Wool. The colors are black, rust, orange, taupe and beige. Design is on the front side only. The back side is a solid cotton fabric with a hidden zipper closure. This boho pillow cover would be ideal on a bed, sofa, couch, arm chair, bench or in your baby's nursery. Insert Not Included. You will receive the pillow cover only, the insert is not included. We recommend using an insert that is 1-2 inches larger than the cover for a nice and full finished pillow. We used 20x20 down feather inserts to fill the pillows you see in the photos. Decorative Use Only: This pillow cover is intended for a decorative pillow only, not for comfort. Care & Instructions: It is not recommended to machine wash or tumble dry. For best results, spot clean with a damp cloth or soft brush and lay flat to dry. Use a lint roller or soft bristled brush to remove hair or lint. Support a Small Business. Casa Boho is a female-owned business located near Dallas, TX. We offer a wide selection of boho throw pillows and home textiles sourced from countries around the globe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714qUz7ByjL._AC_SL1342_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CASA BOHO","source_asin":"B08Z1P7WZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-667989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z1P7WZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z1P7WZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
